  "name": "Chilli Paneer",
  "subtitle": "Crisp paneer in a hot, tangy sauce",
  "description": "Golden paneer cubes are coated with seasoned flour, sautéed, and finished with ginger, garlic, vegetables, and a glossy chilli-soy sauce. Serve with cooked rice.",
